{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295720/extras/576255a20b7da12d3eea27f02fc0a76f.poster.avif?t=1773745029\" width=780 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295720/extras/576255a20b7da12d3eea27f02fc0a76f.webm?t=1773745029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295720/extras/576255a20b7da12d3eea27f02fc0a76f.mp4?t=1773745029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc9fSynopsis\ud83d\udc9f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On my usual way home, in the corner of the street, You found a kitten waiting for adoption... but not only! There was a girl?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reason behind her running away home appears to be more than just a whim. What follows is a heart-pounding cohabitation, and a gradual unveiling of the girl\u2019s mysterious background. The once quiet and ordinary life takes a dramatic turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where will this forced cohabitation, and the &quot;dream,&quot; ultimately lead?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295720/extras/c39b418caf6b5f758971b52d801ea643.poster.avif?t=1773745029\" width=780 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295720/extras/c39b418caf6b5f758971b52d801ea643.webm?t=1773745029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295720/extras/c39b418caf6b5f758971b52d801ea643.mp4?t=1773745029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc9fCharacter\ud83d\udc9f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295720/extras/8ba9484d5252ef920600c622ba32217f.avif?t=1773745029\" width=780 height=496 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc9f<strong>Gameplay</strong>\ud83d\udc9f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, you get to choose how you spend your time with Mili!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can go on dates together, or work hard for both of your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And in the evening, there's always time for intimate moments with Mili.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295720/extras/2307a5fc3839ec65bf5225eb6ff4a5ef.avif?t=1773745029\" width=780 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Game system where you choose daily actions with a cute girl. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Rich and exciting main and side stories with multiple endings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Beautiful character portraits and dynamic CGs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Fully voiced performances that recreate sweet and passionate moments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Various H-scenes that gradually unlock as the story progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295720/extras/2e2fa5d11e9e3862dd97966cdeea03e8.avif?t=1773745029\" width=780 height=438 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3295720?t=1773745029","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3295720?t=177374